[en.FOCUS_C09_INTER_PURCHASE_TIREK]
Overseas Office

[en.FOCUS_C09_INTER_PURCHASE_TIREK_desc]
Trade contacts with Lord Tirek have begun, and due to the distance, it is necessary to establish an overseas office to better trade with Lord Tirek.

[zh.FOCUS_C09_INTER_PURCHASE_TIREK]
远洋办事处

[zh.FOCUS_C09_INTER_PURCHASE_TIREK_desc]
与提雷克大王的贸易接触已经开始，由于遥远的距离，我们有必要设立一个远洋办事处，以便更好地与提雷克大王进行贸易往来。

